[{:db/id "q-114033/selection/7b9970927b2dd83c5fa0f72f661c572075f63de1d1b70be88b465e9c8160fc6d" :answer/id #uuid "e1ce7b9f-1b1f-5412-885b-5aec87e22bd4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114033/selection/1af8059f5110e1943a69d3307606e517ed68a2481b41ad3c031e3e02b79e85eb" :answer/id #uuid "71bf5bb6-53f4-52e6-9185-cb27120e2868" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114033/selection/fbda06568db6d9a3091de9a396ac898224739e79a116de7ba412a11de9fe84c9" :answer/id #uuid "c07d7ce6-cac4-58c2-b80a-d72cadc7f4e3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114033/selection/65785259312ba3619ad7dd83a6f22d21ea0206c7bc52d2e1031b9ecdc77c2846" :answer/id #uuid "bd0cbf7d-8fc4-5457-a66a-8ba6e20f03fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114033/selection/d59716c54325f060c210c240d10da8050c8d98b14dad7a953b28c5f1cf292fd8" :answer/id #uuid "7239cb71-4f12-5950-b55e-47b880e374dc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(6x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114033/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "43bade0d-6102-5b59-b3a9-fc5f86ad2c80" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114033/selection/1af8059f5110e1943a69d3307606e517ed68a2481b41ad3c031e3e02b79e85eb" :answer-field/choices ["q-114033/selection/7b9970927b2dd83c5fa0f72f661c572075f63de1d1b70be88b465e9c8160fc6d" "q-114033/selection/1af8059f5110e1943a69d3307606e517ed68a2481b41ad3c031e3e02b79e85eb" "q-114033/selection/fbda06568db6d9a3091de9a396ac898224739e79a116de7ba412a11de9fe84c9" "q-114033/selection/65785259312ba3619ad7dd83a6f22d21ea0206c7bc52d2e1031b9ecdc77c2846" "q-114033/selection/d59716c54325f060c210c240d10da8050c8d98b14dad7a953b28c5f1cf292fd8"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114033" :question/id #uuid "298e963a-ce31-5466-a327-a97e7b96e3d6" :question/math-academy-id "q-114033" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{3}{1+36{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "This integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have $36{x}^{2}=(6x)^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=6x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=6\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{1+36{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =3\\int \\frac{1}{1+(6x)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =3\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{6}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(6x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-114033/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "227abe29-6e31-5afd-b0ca-3b8ed7d8c287"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114033"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114055/selection/d09fd4e1778ab4997993c0e7611dc461bf27b362de7c9288816ab4d584cd7d5e" :answer/id #uuid "f5ca3b7e-6cbd-5c64-9a92-15c80432df71" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{7}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114055/selection/e63c055e98b1c11152447fcb4cfa699fc1adf7e446cbab99b9e578a7d312a66c" :answer/id #uuid "2c8f6ca3-0450-51c8-937b-b837efe2a41d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{arcsec}(7x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114055/selection/4b59ebfaeeb4d5e9d6014ef43abf9329d359660b4cd1a200ee7afdd380cfe478" :answer/id #uuid "02128603-73ff-5fe6-b741-2f7c9c4e81ae" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{7}}{7}\\,\\text{arcsec}(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114055/selection/91c9d97637840e7665655dcbed2ccc0e254bf0bced6190d2d116feefb00cf1fa" :answer/id #uuid "282719bf-558a-5d37-8851-6bc4de23d2fd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7\\sqrt{7}\\,\\text{arcsec}(x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114055/selection/3698191b84bf4945d133d7a9c8fd181eab55d2bbefb9b3c761c3ccafe53aa7a1" :answer/id #uuid "e7159a3d-ec8e-5f83-aa7f-107534ab4dee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{7}x)+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114055/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "00edf96d-388d-510c-9abf-66bfe44e45fb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114055/selection/3698191b84bf4945d133d7a9c8fd181eab55d2bbefb9b3c761c3ccafe53aa7a1" :answer-field/choices ["q-114055/selection/d09fd4e1778ab4997993c0e7611dc461bf27b362de7c9288816ab4d584cd7d5e" "q-114055/selection/e63c055e98b1c11152447fcb4cfa699fc1adf7e446cbab99b9e578a7d312a66c" "q-114055/selection/4b59ebfaeeb4d5e9d6014ef43abf9329d359660b4cd1a200ee7afdd380cfe478" "q-114055/selection/91c9d97637840e7665655dcbed2ccc0e254bf0bced6190d2d116feefb00cf1fa" "q-114055/selection/3698191b84bf4945d133d7a9c8fd181eab55d2bbefb9b3c761c3ccafe53aa7a1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114055" :question/id #uuid "869c43e1-4bc9-51db-925b-6c1dc9459243" :question/math-academy-id "q-114055" :question/problem "Calculate $\\int \\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{7{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Note that we can rewrite this integral as\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{7{x}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x=\\int \\frac{7\\sqrt{7}}{|\\sqrt{7}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{7}x)^{2}-1}}\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nThis integral now resembles the basic one for $\\text{arcsec},$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\text{d}u=\\text{arcsec}(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of $u$ as the variable, we have $\\sqrt{7}x.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\sqrt{7}x.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\sqrt{7}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{7{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{7\\sqrt{7}}{|\\sqrt{7}x|\\sqrt{(\\sqrt{7}x)^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =7\\sqrt{7}\\int \\frac{1}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =7\\sqrt{7}\\cdot \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{7}}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{|u|\\sqrt{{u}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =7\\,\\text{arcsec }u+C \\\\  & =7\\,\\text{arcsec}(\\sqrt{7}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-114055/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8d18bdc7-9387-5b2d-98bd-015fa4a1eba7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114055"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-114080/selection/73984563d98bead66492e16ce038229e9c23833cc6e35a0f761a454d44664537" :answer/id #uuid "e5599341-a5a5-5cd4-8c05-af43c4f10e5c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{24}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114080/selection/84aaba064027e7eb0bf329f6bc084c93277c0b932bcb0178f06baf24c9b9c48a" :answer/id #uuid "3e3bb541-797b-5901-a924-9d4a91ed3bb1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3\\pi }{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114080/selection/1e940709a1b00fa910544fd0093551b452ea4b241ad5d9959525312e8a27fa19" :answer/id #uuid "20fb36d6-035a-5391-ba4f-bd9e7475c99f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{8}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114080/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" :answer/id #uuid "fad3bede-bbb5-53bd-a0ea-f7b2e39a6ed8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114080/selection/e5c63bc832c49e18fb2678001d953240c26767b2f942793f012ef9f6442d3680" :answer/id #uuid "96c9b401-58a9-588e-b624-e330bfdeb3a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{8\\pi }{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-114080/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "460d7418-1ca7-5dc3-946f-fd68dee12a65" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-114080/selection/e5c63bc832c49e18fb2678001d953240c26767b2f942793f012ef9f6442d3680" :answer-field/choices ["q-114080/selection/73984563d98bead66492e16ce038229e9c23833cc6e35a0f761a454d44664537" "q-114080/selection/84aaba064027e7eb0bf329f6bc084c93277c0b932bcb0178f06baf24c9b9c48a" "q-114080/selection/1e940709a1b00fa910544fd0093551b452ea4b241ad5d9959525312e8a27fa19" "q-114080/selection/adbad78d33491a071139fe589fefda7e9ba65cf97ebbcae14d252ac90459e198" "q-114080/selection/e5c63bc832c49e18fb2678001d953240c26767b2f942793f012ef9f6442d3680"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-114080" :question/id #uuid "5e4c70d4-0535-5065-80e6-9431b5d6608c" :question/math-academy-id "q-114080" :question/problem "Evaluate the integral ${\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =8{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4\\cdot (1-{x}^{2}/4)}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{8}{2}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{x}^{2}/4}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse sine,\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(u)+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{2})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{2}.$ Differentiating, we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=2\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nBefore substituting, we use the table below to change the limits from $x$ to $u.$\n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $\\sqrt{3}$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $u$ | $0$ | $\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ |\n\nUsing the above, we can now write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{8}{\\sqrt{4-{x}^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x & =4{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-(x/2)^{2}}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}/2}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}}\\cdot (2\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =8{\\int }_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}/2}\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\sqrt{1-{u}^{2}}} \\\\  & =8\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡u{|}_{0}^{\\sqrt{3}/2} \\\\  & =8(\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2})-\\operatorname{arcsin}⁡(0)) \\\\  & =8(\\frac{\\pi }{3}-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{8\\pi }{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-114080/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "f2f9806d-3a72-5f0a-a6f4-db8dad8871f6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-114080"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
